OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at the
OL,7,     FBrighton Surf Hotel, where Jeremy
OL,8,     FMann and his Russian wife Elena
OL,9,     Fhope that their hands-off hosting
OL,10,     Fstyle will win the day, despite
OL,11,     Fthe lack of breakfast.
OL,12,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FActor and antiques dealer Robert
OL,14,     FGray hosts at Number 16, in
OL,15,     FGreenwich, London. He charms his
OL,16,     Fguests with his hosting, but Jan
OL,17,     Fand Les find the dusty decor
OL,18,     Foff-putting.
